    "detailed_description": "<strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Prepare to test your skills in fast-paced, precise combat that emphasizes the importance of timing, parrying, and countering enemy attacks. The game is finely tuned to reward players who approach battles with finesse and strategy, while recklessness will carry consequences. Your mastery of the blade and the supernatural abilities at your disposal will be crucial in overcoming the many challenges that lie ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/8f556e71e1beb0f7b5f703416c72774b.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/8f556e71e1beb0f7b5f703416c72774b.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/8f556e71e1beb0f7b5f703416c72774b.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Dynamic Duo:</strong> Unleash the power of co-op play as you take on the roles of Ryota and Diago. Each character offers a distinct playstyle, complementing the other. Ryota, driven by vengeance for a grave betrayal , wields his newfound supernatural abilities. Diago, with hidden motives of his own, provides vital support.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/03595165d4f6ce2f152e2917b6354ec4.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/03595165d4f6ce2f152e2917b6354ec4.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/03595165d4f6ce2f152e2917b6354ec4.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Adversaries Await:</strong> Stand against an array of formidable foes, from cunning Shinobis to relentless Shoguns and honorable Samurais. The path of revenge is perilous, and your skills will be put to the test. As New Secrets of the Demon lie withing the heart of Honshu.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/96fc4bd6641e8435cc37280ee86adc13.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/96fc4bd6641e8435cc37280ee86adc13.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/96fc4bd6641e8435cc37280ee86adc13.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore the Land of Honshu:</strong> Journey through a meticulously crafted world inspired by feudal Japan. Traverse diverse landscapes, uncover hidden lore, and confront the ghosts of the past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/5590b279832a6609145260c972e7b929.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/5590b279832a6609145260c972e7b929.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/5590b279832a6609145260c972e7b929.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Mysterious Powers Unveiled: </strong>As Ryota, harness supernatural abilities and discover the truth behind your newfound powers. Diago's enigmatic reasons for aiding you slowly come to light, adding depth to the unfolding narrative.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/3a92557c64031b7310b4793d4490d87f.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/3a92557c64031b7310b4793d4490d87f.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/3a92557c64031b7310b4793d4490d87f.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Unlock the Secrets:</strong> Uncover the secrets that lie at the heart of Honshu. With each swing of your blade and each step forward, the mysteries of this world will unravel, leading to a climax you won't see coming.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/e56c1a693ed8775a56ecb4dca67fdf29.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/e56c1a693ed8775a56ecb4dca67fdf29.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/e56c1a693ed8775a56ecb4dca67fdf29.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>&quot;Shadows of Destruction&quot; </strong><i>is not just a game; it's an immersive journey into a realm of darkness, honor, and revenge. Will you emerge from the shadows victorious, or will the secrets of Honshu claim you? The answer lies in your hands.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Prepare to test your skills in fast-paced, precise combat that emphasizes the importance of timing, parrying, and countering enemy attacks. The game is finely tuned to reward players who approach battles with finesse and strategy, while recklessness will carry consequences. Your mastery of the blade and the supernatural abilities at your disposal will be crucial in overcoming the many challenges that lie ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/8f556e71e1beb0f7b5f703416c72774b.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/8f556e71e1beb0f7b5f703416c72774b.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/8f556e71e1beb0f7b5f703416c72774b.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Dynamic Duo:</strong> Unleash the power of co-op play as you take on the roles of Ryota and Diago. Each character offers a distinct playstyle, complementing the other. Ryota, driven by vengeance for a grave betrayal , wields his newfound supernatural abilities. Diago, with hidden motives of his own, provides vital support.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/03595165d4f6ce2f152e2917b6354ec4.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/03595165d4f6ce2f152e2917b6354ec4.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/03595165d4f6ce2f152e2917b6354ec4.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Adversaries Await:</strong> Stand against an array of formidable foes, from cunning Shinobis to relentless Shoguns and honorable Samurais. The path of revenge is perilous, and your skills will be put to the test. As New Secrets of the Demon lie withing the heart of Honshu.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/96fc4bd6641e8435cc37280ee86adc13.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/96fc4bd6641e8435cc37280ee86adc13.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/96fc4bd6641e8435cc37280ee86adc13.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore the Land of Honshu:</strong> Journey through a meticulously crafted world inspired by feudal Japan. Traverse diverse landscapes, uncover hidden lore, and confront the ghosts of the past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/5590b279832a6609145260c972e7b929.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/5590b279832a6609145260c972e7b929.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/5590b279832a6609145260c972e7b929.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Mysterious Powers Unveiled: </strong>As Ryota, harness supernatural abilities and discover the truth behind your newfound powers. Diago's enigmatic reasons for aiding you slowly come to light, adding depth to the unfolding narrative.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/3a92557c64031b7310b4793d4490d87f.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/3a92557c64031b7310b4793d4490d87f.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/3a92557c64031b7310b4793d4490d87f.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Unlock the Secrets:</strong> Uncover the secrets that lie at the heart of Honshu. With each swing of your blade and each step forward, the mysteries of this world will unravel, leading to a climax you won't see coming.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/e56c1a693ed8775a56ecb4dca67fdf29.poster.avif?t=1733779566\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/e56c1a693ed8775a56ecb4dca67fdf29.webm?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886990/extras/e56c1a693ed8775a56ecb4dca67fdf29.mp4?t=1733779566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>&quot;Shadows of Destruction&quot; </strong><i>is not just a game; it's an immersive journey into a realm of darkness, honor, and revenge. Will you emerge from the shadows victorious, or will the secrets of Honshu claim you? The answer lies in your hands.</i>",
